<%# Not found: a person or member out of the writer's reach, a participant removed, or a meeting
    moved meanwhile (before the request: the lookup; during it: the lock). The dialog instance
    goes and the reason comes as a flash. Nothing of the meeting is drawn again, so a moved
    meeting shows nothing of the project it is in now; the instance is named by the meeting id
    of the route, because the meeting itself may not be found here. %>
<% if @modal_token %>
  <%= turbo_stream.remove participant_link_modal_instance_id(@meeting_id, @modal_token) %>
<% end %>
<%= turbo_stream.prepend 'flash', partial: 'layouts/flash', locals: { flash: { alert: @errors.to_sentence } } %>
